# Bioengineered Future only counts lands that entered this turn and only helps its controller's creatures and nothing else. Bot1
# played a Forest on turn 1, so on turn 3 Memnite is a plain 1/1. Bot2's Ornithopter, cast on its own turn, and its Ashcoat Bear,
# flashed in on turn 3 after Bot1's new Island, stay 0/2 and 2/2; Bot1's Mox Jet, not a creature, gets no counter (CR 614.1c).

